Z||000000||Dan86gt3.8||03-20-2000||11:07 AM||||Ya I was heading sout bound I-35 (back to school , spring break is over  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">) and I see this pair of blue headlight and foglights whipping around through traffic and it roll up next to me in the right lane and slows to my speed, I floored it and my revs slowly climbed, and then it kicked down and it looked like he downshifted, we satyed side by side for like a second after my tranny kickd down to 3rd and then I motored away and just started putting on car lengths, I was at 100 in no time, but all was safe cause the nearest trafiic was a good 5-10 cars uo and it wass just a big rig in the right lane.  Of sourse after I slowed back down to 75-80 he/she (it might have ben a girl, dark tint and I reallly couldn't tell)did the always classic ricer fly by.  I just rolled my eyes and thought about buying some 90 hp blue headlights.||||reg||6
