Z||000006||turbo86se||03-21-2000||11:39 AM||||Yeah, I'm getting rather annoyed with seeing these lights on old beat up Hyundais and Sentras that can barely move at all. Guess they think the lights and 5" tail pipe makes their car run faster! YOU GOTTA FEED THE MICE!!!<P>Anyways, I'll fess up and admit I thought the blue streak headlights were cool about two years ago and installed them on my 86SE. I'm more than through with that phase, and I don't even remember the last time I drove my baby at night! If anyone wants them, LMK. I'll sell'em cheap. I bought them from the Fiero Store and have the reciept. If not, they'll be on ebay.<BR>Thanks!!!!           -joel  ||||reg||12
