Z||000017||SloPonti||03-22-2000||01:19 AM||||now don't get me wrong here! i love fieros and will never own an import! but i think some of them are cool! i like the tips and that is why i have the 4 and a half inch tips on mine! i also have a few stickers my ram air one and i will me putting  superxmotorsports windshield decal on but my fiero is tastlfully done and so are some imports! i also get the import catalogue from summitt because i have found that alot of that stuff in there will also work on my fiero with little or no modification! yes some rice boys are wierd but also look at the mustang guys to-they think if you drive a mustang you are something then-i think since i drive a fiero i am something-it is just because it is our thing-god bless the fieros! just my 2 cents though! i think the rice boy thing is just the new generation thing!||||reg||1
