Z||000019||phillip||03-22-2000||08:58 AM|||| i have to agree with sloponti. i like my fiero but if they have an idea or part that i like i'll try to adapt it to my  car. i just have the 2.5 (hoping for more later), but as a "for looks" car i feel i'm ahead already. i'd really love to have one of those agressive looking front ends and if i had a white or silver car (i'm kind of looking at a white '88 coupe), i'd get the white tailights for it if i could. i think the variety of options let you make the car more your own.||||reg||1
Z||000020||Spyder||03-22-2000||11:10 AM||||Ok here is my take on the rice boys:<P>A rice boy is someone who thinks they are fast when they are not.<P>They have stickers all over there car, which they can not back it up.<BR>They have some mods that are over the top on benefiting the cars ability. Like a 1000 cfm air intake filter.<BR>The catfish type opening on the front, that car doesn’t need that much air.<BR>The huge wing on the back will only slow the car down.<BR>Now Twin Turbo Supras with stickers and a big wing with coffee can exhaust, Not a Rice Boy.<P>I read all types of magazines:<BR>Turbo, Super Street, LowRider, Kit Car, Hot Rod and a bunch of others.<BR>I am a car nut, I love to see how people do things and how they do them different. I get all kinds of ideas from these guys.<BR>The Latino cars used to make me sick, the ones with the murals airbrushed, the hydraulics, the fuzzy interiors, but now I appreciate the work and time involved in the creation of their work of art.  Personally I think it is UGLY but I appreciate the motivation behind it and the money spent. ||||reg||1
Z||000021||Dan86gt3.8||03-22-2000||03:43 PM||||Props to the guy who posted the pic ove the most ridicou;lous ricer move ever!  I am still laughing!!!!!!!!!!!!!  Anyways don't get me wrong some "ricers" are ok guys that are just trying to make thier cars faster.  I am not even sure the guy I racede was a ricer actually I think it was a girl, she didn't have stickers just blue headlights and a tip.  And yes i have all the respect for guys with the turbo's.  Like ther is a guy at the local cruise strip that has an eclipse GSX (the all wheel drive, intercooled, turbo) and he doesen't do fly by's and crap like that.  And when he puls over he doesen't make outlandish claims like he can beat all v8's.  He says he runs a 13 and thats the only thing i have against him.  Cause when we raced he didn't start pulling me till 85-90 and I actually git the jump on hims so AWD isn't all that.  but anyways I guess I am through with my ranting, so overall some are cool and some are complete dicks, but hey its the same with the camaro/mustang guys, some are cool and some are dicks.  Anywyas I am still laughing about that stupid a$$ tip.  I would run that guy into a tree if I saw him driving that thing on the road. Or maybee he's making fun, I would like to talk to him!!!!!!!!!!!||||reg||1
