Z||000023||TwisT||03-22-2000||08:22 PM||||Guys,  guys,  guys...  I get home from work today to the most laughable picture I've seen in a LONG time!  THAT is HILARIOUS!!!<P>About the exhaust tips;  you know,  I admit,  looking at an ass-ugly exhaust pipe is not attractive;  rusty and boring as hell!  A little performance "look" through the addition of tips is a easy fix and does a good job dressing a vehicle up.  But DAMN!!!  When I see a four-door four-bangin' Civic sporting that cantelope-shooting coffee-can,  what can you say but "WHY?!?!?!"<P>...THEN you laugh your ass off.  Heh he heeeeee.... <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">    ||||reg||1
