Z||000026||Fformula88||03-22-2000||11:15 PM||||That cannot be an exhaust tip for an ordinary engine.  It must be a nozzle for a rocket booster! hehehe<P>Not all modded cars are ricemobiles.  There are a lot of guys who do sensible mods to their cars to make them look better and go faster.  The funny ones are the 10 year old cars with faded paint and rust holes all over, along with a BIG shiney tip on the exhaust, a million stickers for aftermarket parts that will never be on the car, and exhaust not of a dustbuster.  I guess even they are just taking pride in what they have, as is everyone else. ||||reg||1
